data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> (signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\)</span> (logical axiom set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (arithmetic axiom set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"89c266445c099752\" href=\"?note=89c266445c099752\" title=\"92-ax-peano-arithmetic\">92-ax-peano-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}\\)</span> (modus ponens rule, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> (generalization rule, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}\\)</span> (formal-system predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}g\\text{-}system}\\vdash\nG\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{FormalSys}(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}g\\text{-}system}\\vdash\nG\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{FormalSys}(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> : Smullyan的核心形式系统</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> : 包含逻辑符号和算术符号的签名</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{logic}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{logic}}\\)</span> : 逻辑公理（命题逻辑和谓词逻辑）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> : 算术公理（Peano算术变体）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> 是规则实例的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> 本身不是单个规则实例</li>\n<li>Smullyan的系统G是展示不完备性的核心工具</li>\n<li>系统G可以表达和证明足够多的算术事实</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-logical-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"e948c25f4a467fa1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-logical-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"89c266445c099752","anchor":"ref-4","targe